GT Trackball -- licensing
=========================

This repository contains two kinds of work under two licences.

1. Hardware design -- Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
   (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

   Applies to: trackball_bt_case.scad, everything in print/ and images/.

   This design is a remix of "3-Inch Arcade Trackball Case"
   (https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:7334881) by vkschannel, itself a
   remix of https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:5914322, both licensed
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike. As required by that licence,
   this remix is shared under the same terms. If you share or remix it,
   credit vkschannel and this project, and keep the same licence.

2. Software -- MIT License (see LICENSE-CODE)

   Applies to: everything in firmware/, pc/ and renders/, except the
   third-party parts below.

Third-party software
--------------------

- firmware/micropython/*.uf2 is a build of MicroPython v1.29.0
  (https://micropython.org, MIT License, (c) Damien P. George and
  contributors) with the changes in
  firmware/micropython/gt-trackball-micropython-v1.29.0.patch.
- The firmware installs aioble and usb-device-hid from micropython-lib
  (MIT License) with `mpremote mip install`.
